Package: classic-cube
Version: 1.3.8
Section: games
Priority: optional
Architecture: arm64
Depends: libc6, libsdl2-2.0-0, libgles2, libegl1, libx11-6, libxi6, libopenal1
Maintainer: Juan Pablo Lozano <libredeb@gmail.com>
Description: sandbox block-building game
 Classic Cube is a free, open-source sandbox where you place and
 break blocks, explore generated worlds, and build with friends.
 It includes multiplayer, custom texture packs, extra blocks, and
 gamepad support, and is tuned for low-end hardware.
 .
 Not affiliated with Mojang Studios or Microsoft.
